#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:6
msgid "Quit QElectroTech"
msgstr "退出 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:8
msgid ""
"The user can quit QElectroTech at anytime. The user does not need to `close "
"the project`_ before closing the application."
msgstr "用户可以随时退出 QElectroTech。关闭应用程序之前，无需先 `关闭项目 <close the project_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:10
msgid ""
"If the current work wants to be saved before closing the project, refer to "
"`save project`_ section. Even so, QElectroTech displays an automatic message"
" to save the current job if any modification has been created."
msgstr ""
"如果希望在关闭项目之前保存当前工作，请参阅 `保存项目 <save project_>`_ 一节。即便如此，只要进行了任何修改，QElectroTech"
" 都会自动弹出消息以保存当前工作。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Save message"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 保存提示"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:18
msgid ""
"As a large amount of applications which has been developed using `Qt`_, "
"QElectroTech can be closed from the close tab |close_tab| which can be found"
" at top right from main window, from `menu bar`_ or using the corresponding "
"keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"与许多使用 `Qt <Qt_>`_ 开发的应用程序一样，QElectroTech 可以通过主窗口右上角的关闭标签页 |close_tab| "
"关闭，也可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 关闭，或使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:41
msgid "close_tab"
msgstr "close_tab"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:21
msgid "Quit QElectroTech from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏退出 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:23
msgid "Select **File > Quit** menu item to quit QElectroTech."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 退出** 菜单项即可退出 QElectroTech。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech File menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:31
msgid "Quit QElectroTech using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键退出 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:33
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:35
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + q`` to quit QElectroTech."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + q`` 退出 QElectroTech。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/quit.rst:39
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
